{"lesson":{"title":"Buy Time. Use It.","hook":"Two decisions. Watch how your reply and recovery shape the next ball.","livePoint":true,"branch":"lp1","nodes":{"lp1A":{"scene":"lp1A","ph":"Live Point","short":"Read","name":"When do you recover?","sit":"Your flatter reply through the middle is on its way.","q":"When do you recover?","opts":["Recover now; split as they hit","Watch their direction, then recover"],"correct":0,"lines":{"A":"You used the flight time to move back towards coverage.","B":"You watched the shot. They hit while you were still wide."},"noTargets":true,"rail":["Watch","Choose","See what changes"],"unlock":"Read the next situation","take":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","payoff":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","principle":"Your reply buys time. Your movement puts it to work.","why":"Move towards a position that covers their available angles while your ball travels. Time your split around their contact, then respond to what they actually hit. This quicker reply leaves less recovery time; starting promptly still helps.","continuation":true},"lp1B":{"scene":"lp1B","ph":"Live Point","short":"Read","name":"When do you recover?","sit":"Your higher crosscourt reply is on its way.","q":"When do you recover?","opts":["Recover now; split as they hit","Watch their direction, then recover"],"correct":0,"lines":{"A":"You used the flight time to move back towards coverage.","B":"You watched the shot. They hit while you were still wide."},"noTargets":true,"rail":["Watch","Choose","See what changes"],"unlock":"Read the next situation","take":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","payoff":"Start recovering during your shot. Read their hit to adjust.","principle":"Your reply buys time. Your movement puts it to work.","why":"Move towards a position that covers their available angles while your ball travels. Time your split around their contact, then respond to what they actually hi